        "TileImage": "$($repository 131a38bf-c02a-4fc3-a109-59431450aa5f).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.\r\rWelcome to Dartmoor. The Carsisle estate is hosting its annual garden show, but something far more serious is taking place. Theodore Tinker, Iver Nathans, Arthur Jackson-Todd and Barry Jackson-Todd are all attending. They are the four direct top agents of our main adversary, making this the most dangerous operation yet. We don’t know what they’re planning. Find out, then eliminate all four. Be careful, 47. \r\rGood luck.",
